<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>学途</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .nav {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 0.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .nav a {
            color: #337ab7;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 1rem;
        }
        .nav a:hover {
            color: #23527c;
        }
        .hero {
            background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f7f7f7, #e7e7e7);
            padding: 5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .feature {
            margin: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            width: 200px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 0.25rem;
        }
        .feature h3 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            clear: both;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>学途</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="nav">
        <a href="courses.html">课程</a>
        <a href="about.html">关于</a>
        <a href="register.html">注册</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero">
        <h2>提升技能，成就未来</h2>
        <p>学途提供多种课程，帮助您掌握语言、计算机技能和考试备考。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>语言课程</h3>
            <p>英语、中文、日语等语言课程，帮助您提升语言能力。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>计算机技能</h3>
            <p>编程、数据分析、网络安全等课程，帮助您掌握前沿技术。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>考试备考</h3>
            <p>托福、雅思、考研等考试备考课程，帮助您取得优异成绩。</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2023 学途</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

